    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Floor Area: 96 sqm (1033sqft)\n\nFlynn Estate Agents are delighted to present No. 8 Doon Avenue to the market. A rare opportunity to acquire this 3 bedroom semi-detached family home, situated on a generous site on Doon Avenue, just off the North Circular Road in Dublin 7. Offering huge scope and potential, this property is ideally suited to those looking to renovate and upgrade to their own specification, whether as a family home or an investment.\n\nThe accommodation is well proportioned throughout and offers a solid foundation for a new owner to add their own stamp, subject to any necessary planning permission. A particular feature of the property is the side garden, which offers excellent potential for extension (subject to planning permission) or additional outdoor amenity space.\n\nDoon Avenue enjoys a highly convenient Dublin 7 location, within easy reach of the North Circular Road, Phoenix Park, and the city centre. The area benefits from excellent transport links, a wide range of local amenities, schools, and is close to the Luas and major arterial routes, making it a popular choice for buyers and renovators alike.\n\nProperties offering this level of potential in such a central and sought-after location rarely come to the market. Viewing is highly recommended.\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "Hallway - 1.83m (6'0\") x 4.96m (16'3\")\nwith carpet, alarm panel & understair storage.\n\nLiving Room - 4.26m (14'0\") x 3.56m (11'8\")\nwith large bay window, carpet flooring & feature stove with timber panelled surround.\n\nKitchen - 2.45m (8'0\") x 2.01m (6'7\")\nwith a range of floor & eye level fitted press units with tiled splashback.\n\nDining Room - 4.26m (14'0\") x 3.42m (11'3\")\nwith laminate wood flooring.\n\nBathroom - 3m (9'10\") x 2.5m (8'2\")\nwith w.c, w.h.b, & electric shower.Tiled floor & partially tiled walls.\n\nLanding - 1.43m (4'8\") x 2.53m (8'4\")\nwith carpet flooring.\n\nBedroom 1 - 3.98m (13'1\") x 4.18m (13'9\")\nto front of house with carpet, built in wardrobes & large bay window.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.64m (11'11\") x 2.8m (9'2\")\nto rear of house with laminate wood floor & built in wardrobes.\n\nBedroom 3 - 2.1m (6'11\") x 2.94m (9'8\")\nto front of house with carpet flooring & built in wardrobes.\n\nBathroom - 1.66m (5'5\") x 1.9m (6'3\")\nwith w.h.b. & electric shower. Laminate wood flooring & partially tiled walls.\n\nW.C - 0.7m (2'4\") x 1.38m (4'6\")\nw.c with laminate wood flooring\n\n"
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li> 3 Bedroom Semi-detached </li><li> Gar Fired Central Heating </li><li> Exellent transport links </li><li> Close to Phoenix Park & City Center </li><li> Huge scope for renovation & upgrading </li><li> Side garden with extension potential subject to (planning permission)</li></ul>"
      },
